{
  "name": "05 飞书表格 AI 管家 · 成品⑤",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-05",
      "name": "使用说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🗂️ 飞书表格 AI 管家（实战三·成品⑤）\n\n**它做什么**：读你的飞书多维表格 → AI 逐行看懂「客户反馈」→ 打上「分类 / 紧急度」标签 → 自动写回表格。几百行人肉归类的活，一杯水的功夫干完。\n\n**上手四步**：\n1. 按课程 5-1 把飞书侧四件事办好（建表 + 建自建应用 + 开 bitable 权限并发布 + 把应用加为表格协作者）\n2. 在「填四样信息」节点里换成你自己的 App ID / App Secret / app_token / table_id\n3. 配 DeepSeek 凭证（同模板 02）\n4. Execute Workflow → 去飞书刷新表格，看标签一行行被填上\n\n**⚠️ 报「权限不足」**：九成是应用没加为表格协作者，或权限开了没发布版本。\n\n**举一反三**：换一张表 + 改一句提示词（分类标准换成你的业务），就是线索意向分级、简历初筛、工单分派——一切「逐行读懂再归类」的活。",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-05",
      "name": "手动触发",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 260],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "config-05",
      "name": "填四样信息",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [680, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-appid",
              "name": "app_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "换成你的AppID(cli_开头)"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-secret",
              "name": "app_secret",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "换成你的AppSecret"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-apptoken",
              "name": "app_token",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "换成表格网址/base/后面那串"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-tableid",
              "name": "table_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "换成表格网址?table=后面tbl开头那串"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "token-05",
      "name": "拿通行证",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [880, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"app_id\": \"{{ $json.app_id }}\", \"app_secret\": \"{{ $json.app_secret }}\" }",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "read-05",
      "name": "读取表格记录",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1080, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bitable/v1/apps/{{ $('填四样信息').first().json.app_token }}/tables/{{ $('填四样信息').first().json.table_id }}/records",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.tenant_access_token }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "split-05",
      "name": "拆成一行一条",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "data.items",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chain-05",
      "name": "AI 逐行打标",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [1480, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=你是客服主管。读下面这条用户反馈,输出 JSON,两个字段:分类(只能从:咨询/售后/故障/建议 四选一)、紧急度(高/中/低)。直接返回纯 JSON,不要```代码块,不要解释。反馈内容:{{ $json.fields.客户反馈 }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model-05",
      "name": "DeepSeek 大模型",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatDeepSeek",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1480, 480],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "deepseek-chat",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "deepSeekApi": {
          "id": "deepseek-cred",
          "name": "DeepSeek 账号"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tidy-05",
      "name": "整理写回内容",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1700, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "tidy-rid",
              "name": "record_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('拆成一行一条').item.json.record_id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "tidy-cat",
              "name": "分类",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.text.replace(/```json|```/g,'').trim()).分类 }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "tidy-urg",
              "name": "紧急度",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.text.replace(/```json|```/g,'').trim()).紧急度 }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write-05",
      "name": "写回飞书表",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1900, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bitable/v1/apps/{{ $('填四样信息').first().json.app_token }}/tables/{{ $('填四样信息').first().json.table_id }}/records/{{ $json.record_id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $('拿通行证').first().json.tenant_access_token }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"fields\": { \"分类\": \"{{ $json.分类 }}\", \"紧急度\": \"{{ $json.紧急度 }}\" } }",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "手动触发": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "填四样信息",
            "type": "main",
